			],
			"Message": "docs(Rest): Normalize emoji spacing to HTML entities and clean up layout\n\nRemove redundant `&#x2001;` hair-spaces from badge rows and section headings in README.md, and delete an orphaned blank emoji from the Dependencies table to bring consistent formatting across the document.\n\n- Collapse `&#x2001;` separators in Rust badge line and Edition 2024 row so badges align properly on GitHub render\n- Strip trailing `&#x2001;🦋` from the Cocoon table cell entry\n- Remove stray `&#x2001;🧩&#x2001;` spacing around the Common dependency mention\n\nVisual polish only — no semantic or structural changes.",
